    m_Alignment: 1
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '- There are 4 rounds, 5 contestants! Easy to understand, huh!


    -
    You will pick exactly ONE of these 5 to help along this lovely journey! Control
    the greed eh!


    - Not all of them will win the same type of contract! Just
    winning isn''t enough! Some might have more $$$ than others! How to know? Use
    your pop culture knowledge!


    - You have 6 cards that can help you influence
    the odds! They can only be used once


    - BEWARE! The network has not been
    doing too well lately, especially due to..ahem, certain allegations. DON"T LET
    THEM CATCH YOU.'
