  dialogueLines:
  - '*Phone ringing*'
  - Yes.
  - We're sorry for the late notice. Do you think you can start next week?
  - First, how is the contract looking?
  - Not good, best I got was the industry minimum...
  - I see...
  - Expect me next week.
  - Ah! Great! We'll see you soon!
